version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mnsh0409/sensei-go-coach"
url: "https://github.com/mnsh0409/sensei-go-coach"
abstract: >-
  A Go coaching agent: KataGo proposes moves, a selector plays the strong move a player of the learner's rank
  would rarely find under an explicit strength bound, and Muse Spark (Meta Model API) explains it and answers
  questions by calling engine tools, grounded only on facts computed from the engine and the board.
keywords:
  - go
  - baduk
  - weiqi
  - katago
  - large language models
  - tool calling
  - education
